<body>

<div class="page-container">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header-wrapper">
        <div class="header-deco-1"></div>
        <div class="header-deco-2"></div>
        <div class="header-deco-3"></div>
        <div class="header-title">问题解决</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <div class="q-header">
        <div class="q-icon"><span>1</span></div>
        <div class="q-text">汽车已经行了多少千米？</div>
        <div class="red-text" style="font-size: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center;">
            求一个数的几分之几的问题
            <span class="arrow-right"></span>
            用已知量乘分率
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="placeholder s1-bus-img">
        [Illustration: Bus driving on a mountain road. Bubbles pointing to road: "要行84千米。" and to bus: "已经行了全程的 2/3。"]
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 15px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #444;">
        “行了全程的 $\frac{2}{3}$ ” 就是把全程看作单位“1”，已经行了的路程是84km的 $\frac{2}{3}$。
    </div>

    <div class="s1-middle-row">
        <!-- Left Avatar -->
        <div style="width: 20%; text-align: center; padding-top: 10px;">
            <div class="bubble bubble-left" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">怎么理解“已经行<br>了全程的 $\frac{2}{3}$ ”？</div>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 60px; height: 70px; margin: 0 auto; border: none; background: transparent;">[Girl Avatar]</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Center Diagram & Math -->
        <div style="width: 55%; text-align: center;">
            <div class="placeholder s1-line-diag">
                [Diagram: Line segment divided into 3 parts. Bracket over 2 parts labeled "行了全程的 2/3". Bracket under whole line labeled "全程 84km"]
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                可以这样算：$84 \div 3 \times 2 = 56(\text{km})$
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 16px;">
                也可以这样算：$84 \times \frac{2}{3} = \overset{28}{\cancel{84}} \times \frac{2}{\underset{1}{\cancel{3}}} = 56(\text{km})$
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Avatar -->
        <div style="width: 20%; text-align: center; padding-top: 10px;">
            <div class="bubble bubble-right" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">把全程平均分成3<br>份，已经行了2份。</div>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 60px; height: 70px; margin: 0 auto; border: none; background: transparent;">[Boy Avatar]</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="font-size: 16px; padding-left: 10%;">答：汽车已经行了 56km。</div>
        <div class="brown-text" style="font-size: 13px; text-align: left;">
            当分数用来表示单位“1”的几分之几时，也可以叫做“分率”。<br>
            <div style="color: #d32f2f; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;">单位“1” $\times$ 几分之几 = 几分之几对应的量</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Discuss Section -->
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin: 25px 0 10px 0; padding-left: 5%;">
        <div style="background-color: #9CCC65; color: white; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; margin-right: 15px;">议一议</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px;">“ $84 \times \frac{2}{3}$ ”这样列式，你是怎么想的？</div>
    </div>
    <div class="red-text" style="text-align: center; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        求一个数的几分之几是多少。
    </div>


    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <div class="q-header" style="align-items: stretch;">
        <div class="q-icon"><span>2</span></div>
        <div class="q-text" style="width: 55%; margin-right: 20px;">
            张伯伯把 $20\text{hm}^2$ 土地的 $\frac{3}{4}$ 用来种玫瑰，其中种红玫瑰的面积占玫瑰地面积的 $\frac{3}{5}$。张伯伯种了多少公顷红玫瑰？
        </div>
        <div class="red-text" style="width: 30%; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
            连续求一个数的几分之几的问题
            <div class="arrow-down"></div>
            用已知量连续乘分率
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="s2-row">
        <!-- Left: Boy & Notes -->
        <div class="s2-col-left">
            <div class="bubble bubble-left" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">题中的 $\frac{3}{4}$ 表示什<br>么意思？ $\frac{3}{5}$ 呢？</div>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 60px; height: 70px; border: none; background: transparent; margin-bottom: 15px;">[Boy Avatar]</div>

            <div class="red-text" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: left; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;">$\frac{3}{4}$</span><br>
                表示把 $20\text{hm}^2$ 土地<br>看作单位“1”，其中<br>的 $\frac{3}{4}$ 种玫瑰。
            </div>
            <div class="red-text" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: left; width: 100%;">
                <span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;">$\frac{3}{5}$</span><br>
                表示把种玫瑰的土地看作单位“1”，其中的 $\frac{3}{5}$ 种红玫瑰。
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Center: Grid & Math -->
        <div class="s2-col-center">
            <div style="font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px;">$20\text{hm}^2$ 土地</div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                <div class="placeholder s2-grid">
                    [Diagram: 5x4 grid representing land. 15 squares hatched for rose land. 9 squares shaded pink for red roses.]
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 14px; width: 100px; margin-left: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">
                    $20\text{hm}^2$ 土地的 $\frac{3}{4}$ 种玫瑰
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px; text-align: center; padding-right: 50px;">
                玫瑰地的 $\frac{3}{5}$ 种红玫瑰
            </div>

            <div style="font-size: 16px; margin: 25px 0 15px 0;">
                $20 \times \frac{3}{4} \times \frac{3}{5} = 9(\text{hm}^2)$
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 16px;">
                答：张伯伯种了 $9\text{hm}^2$ 红玫瑰。
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Girl -->
        <div class="s2-col-right">
            <div class="bubble bubble-right" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">还可以怎样解决？</div>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 60px; height: 70px; border: none; background: transparent;">[Girl Avatar]</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Note -->
    <div class="footer-note">
        <span class="red-text" style="font-weight: bold;">注意：</span>分数连乘问题中最基本的数量关系式：单位“1”的量 $\times$ 分率 = 分率的对应量。准确地找出单位“1”的关键在于明确题目中“哪个量是（或占、相当于）哪个量的几分之几”，是哪个量的几分之几，那个量就是单位“1”。
    </div>

    <!-- Page Number -->
    <div class="page-num-container">
        7
        <div class="placeholder" style="width: 35px; height: 35px; border-radius: 50%; margin-left: 8px; border: none; background: #000; color: #fff; font-size: 10px;">[Panda]</div>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
